# Build output/intermediate artifacts for every test program under this
# folder (generated by `make` via z88dk-z80asm/z88dk-appmake - see each
# subfolder's own README.md/makefile). Never commit these; always
# rebuildable from the checked-in *.asm sources. The empty obj/BINZ80/bin
# directories themselves (kept via .gitkeep) are tracked so `make` works
# immediately after a fresh clone without manually creating them first.
*/obj/*
!*/obj/.gitkeep
*/BINZ80/*
!*/BINZ80/.gitkeep
*/bin/*
!*/bin/.gitkeep
